 * Secure implementation of {@code XPathBuilder}.
 *
 * The {@code doGetDocument} method has been hardened against XML External Entity (XXE)
 * attacks. When a {@link Document} is requested the XML is parsed using a
 * {@link DocumentBuilderFactory} that has all external entity resolution disabled.
 * This guarantees that even if the input XML contains malicious DOCTYPE declarations,
 * they will not be processed.
